'''Arch''' is an [[NPC]] located on top of the {{Zone|Stronghold}}. They appear after defeating [[Kuudra]] once.

== Quest ==
If the following conditions are met, and the player interacts with '''Arch''', they will give the player a {{Item|Kuudra Follower Chestplate}}:

6 helpers are required, and must be wearing full {{Item|Ember Armor}} or {{Item|Rekindled Ember Armor}} and have a {{Item|Kuudra Pet}} equipped that is {{Lv|81}} or higher. They must be in the following locations:
* 2 in the {{Zone|Stronghold}} (the {{ID|Kuudra Follower Chestplate{{!}}Chestplate}} can also be claimed by these players)
* 2 in the {{Zone|Dragontail Townsquare}}
* 2 in the {{Zone|Scarleton Plaza}}

The helpers' current factions are irrelevant. Players to claim the {{ID|Kuudra Follower Chestplate{{!}}Chestplate}} have no additional requirements.

